        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3381940/extras/771cc1f2fa8bf91f02e5f09c1646b58f.avif?t=1787620018\" width=548 height=160 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A Score Attack Breakout/Pinball type videogame with Sensory Overloading Surreal Aesthetic and a Totally Awesome Soundtrack!  <br><br>Player must keep track of two eyes simultaneously with their advance perception and high functioning cognition while attempting to Gather points and collect an  accumulated score and attempting to exit stage before failing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stack points, get Multipliers and accumulate the largest score you can without failing</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Learn when to boost and when not to boost</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You get two eyes per run, but only one eye must enter the goal to collect and document the accumulated score</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >23 Unique Stages </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1 Large Tower Stage </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Four Modes: </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Consecutive Mode  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Marathon Mode  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tower Mode  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solo Stage Mode</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3381940/extras/771cc1f2fa8bf91f02e5f09c1646b58f.avif?t=1787620018\" width=548 height=160 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A Score Attack Breakout/Pinball type videogame with Sensory Overloading Surreal Aesthetic and a Totally Awesome Soundtrack!  <br><br>Player must keep track of two eyes simultaneously with their advance perception and high functioning cognition while attempting to Gather points and collect an  accumulated score and attempting to exit stage before failing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stack points, get Multipliers and accumulate the largest score you can without failing</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Learn when to boost and when not to boost</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You get two eyes per run, but only one eye must enter the goal to collect and document the accumulated score</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >23 Unique Stages </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1 Large Tower Stage </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Four Modes: </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Consecutive Mode  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Marathon Mode  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tower Mode  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solo Stage Mode</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
